# the overload guard's first step, brocade's saws (engine.c thin_load), on synthetic loads ("load N": every block
# costs N % as the guard sees it): a block's spike does not thin; a sustained average over 76 %, or four blocks in
# a row over 86 %, does, a pair of saws at a time; they come back a pair each half second once the average is
# under 68 %; with no brocade voice sounding nothing thins and Status shows no saws
wait 300
load 40
preset 3 gold_thread brocade
knob 3 vmode poly
play 3 G3 on
play 3 B3 on
play 3 D4 on
play 3 F4 on
wait 500
expect voices 4
expect saws 9
# brocade and a kit as the FM-1 runs them: 64 % with a block of 82-91 % now and then (note-ons, hits)
load 64
wait 500
load 91
wait 6
load 64
wait 100
load 90
wait 12
load 64
wait 100
load 82
wait 6
load 64
wait 50
load 91
wait 6
load 64
wait 1000
expect saws 9
expect guard 16
# a sustained overload: 82 % on average thins to three saws before the voice guard (85 %) drops voices
load 82
wait 400
expect saws 3
expect guard 16
# recovery: under 68 % for half a second a pair at a time
load 64
wait 300
expect saws 3
wait 400
expect saws 5
wait 500
expect saws 7
wait 500
expect saws 9
# in between (70 %, after a thinning): the saws stay
load 82
wait 400
expect saws 3
load 72
wait 1500
expect saws 3
load 60
wait 2500
expect saws 9
# a load rising too fast for the average: four blocks in a row over 86 % thin a pair (the average still under 76)
load 89
wait 30
expect saws 7
load 60
wait 2000
expect saws 9
# Status says the saws while they are thinned
load 82
wait 400
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
wait 100
listen
where
said saws 3
# no brocade sounding: the cap lifts, nothing on Status
play 3 G3 off
play 3 B3 off
play 3 D4 off
play 3 F4 off
wait 4000
expect voices 0
expect saws 9
where
unsaid saws
# kit and weft at a sustained 82 %: no brocade, nothing thins
preset 3 none weft
knob 3 vmode poly
play 3 G3 on
play 3 B3 on
play 3 D4 on
wait 1000
expect saws 9
where
unsaid saws
play 3 G3 off
play 3 B3 off
play 3 D4 off
load 0
wait 500
